  "title": "Sequans Completes Full Redemption of Convertible Debt, Reestablishes Pure-Play Focus on IoT Semiconductor Growth",
  "summary": "PARIS – May 28, 2026 – Sequans Communications S.A. (NYSE: SQNS) (“Sequans” or the “Company”), a leading provider of 5G/4G cellular IoT semiconductor solutions, today announced the completion of the redemption of all remaining convertible debt issued in July 2025 funded through the sale of a portion of the Company’s Bitcoin holdings. The Company now holds […]",
